-    /// If submission fails, the nonce for the sending address is reset to force a fresh query on
-    /// the next transaction. If the transaction was submitted but its receipt does not arrive
+    /// If submission fails and no RPC knows the transaction's hash, the nonce for the sending address
+    /// is reset to force a fresh query on the next transaction. If an RPC knows it, the transaction is
+    /// on its way, and this carries on as for a send that succeeded. If the transaction was submitted but its receipt does not arrive
     /// (timeout or RPC error), the nonce is kept, because the transaction may still be mined, and
     /// the error carries its hash ([`MetaTransactionSendError::ReceiptUnavailable`]).
     ///
@@ -331,17 +351,38 @@ impl Eip155MetaTransactionProvider for Eip155ChainProvider {
             txr.set_gas_limit(gas_limit)
